                    "text": "Shutdowns don\u2019t happen because Republicans demand fiscal sanity\u2014they happen because Democrats prioritize handouts over accountability. Illinois bureaucrats scramble to prop up coverage for federal workers, but where\u2019s the urgency for taxpayers funding this circus?\n\nThe real issue? Democrats weaponize crises to sneak benefits for illegal immigrants into every bill. Trump\u2019s shutdown stance draws the line: protect American workers, not D.C.\u2019s bloated bureaucracy.\n\nFederal employees deserve relief, but permanent solutions require cutting waste, not expanding the same failed systems that caused this mess.\n\nSee how the numbers and policy maneuvers stack up behind the rhetoric: https://t.co/WXucOVtVZA",
